# CI/CD Workflow Conventions

## Workflows

| File | Trigger | Purpose |
|------|---------|---------|
| `test-build-deploy.yml` | Push/PR to `main`, `src/**` and related config | `npm ci`, `npm run test:run`, `npm run build`; SSH deploy on push to `main` after tests pass |
| `pr-review.yml` | PR opened/synchronized | Automated PR review (if configured) |

## CI requirements

- Node.js 20; npm with frozen lockfile (`npm ci`)
- Must pass: unit tests (`npm run test:run`), production build (`npm run build`)
- Build uses `VITE_API_URL=https://api.retentio.app:8443` in CI

## Rules

- Do not skip CI checks or add `[skip ci]` without team agreement
- New features should include Vitest coverage in `src/**/*.test.{ts,tsx}`
- Deploy job runs only on push to `main` after the test job succeeds
